"summary":"A study of how data analytics, AI, blockchain and robotic process automation affect audit data acquisition, risk identification and procedure execution. The project examines implementation costs, data governance, system reliability and staff capabilities, alongside privacy, security, accountability, independence and professional scepticism as conditions and ethical challenges of technology adoption.",
